  <item>
    <title>米粒大那一塊</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/repair/when-a-cup-breaks/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/repair/when-a-cup-breaks/</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>修器</category>
    <description>杯子碎了，先別急着黏。把每一片收好、拍照、寫下經過，修補由這一刻開始，之後修不修、怎樣修都還有選擇。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>翻到杯外看</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/repair/crackle-or-crack/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/repair/crackle-or-crack/</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>修器</category>
    <description>開片是燒成冷卻時釉面收縮留下的紋，裂縫卻穿過了胎。兩者看起來都是線，分清楚了，才知道一隻杯要不要修、還能不能盛熱茶。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>最後才撒金</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/repair/what-is-kintsugi/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/repair/what-is-kintsugi/</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>修器</category>
    <description>金繕以天然漆接合、填補、上漆，到最後一步才撒金。看上去只是一道金線，下面藏着幾層漆和幾個星期的等待。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>沒有金剛鑽</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/repair/staple-repair/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/repair/staple-repair/</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>修器</category>
    <description>鋦瓷用金剛鑽在裂縫兩邊打淺孔，再以金屬鋦釘跨住裂縫，是中國民間惜物的老手藝；它適合胎身較厚的器物，也有它的限度。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>啞的還是亮的</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/repair/is-it-real-gold/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/repair/is-it-real-gold/</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>修器</category>
    <description>金粉、金箔、黃銅粉和仿金顏料，看起來都是金色；價錢、日後會不會變色、能不能碰茶，差別就藏在材料裏。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>先倒進公道杯</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/repair/hot-tea-in-repaired-cups/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/repair/hot-tea-in-repaired-cups/</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>修器</category>
    <description>修過的杯可以喝茶，但要看修補的材料、完成了多久、平日泡甚麼茶；悶泡老茶和煮茶，尤其要多想一步。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>留給自己那隻</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/repair/repaired-cup-at-the-table/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/repair/repaired-cup-at-the-table/</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>修器</category>
    <description>修過的杯當然可以上茶席，還常常成為一席茶的話題；只是擺出來之前，先想好給誰用、客人問起時怎樣說，大家才喝得安心。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>那排釘不要拆</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/repair/grandmothers-bowl/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/repair/grandmothers-bowl/</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>修器</category>
    <description>一隻不值錢的舊碗，修不修？我會先問它在家裏怎樣被用過，因為器物的價值，有時在價錢以外，在一家人記得的那些日子。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>拿得穩才好看</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/first-gaiwan/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/first-gaiwan/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>入門沖泡</category>
    <description>初學蓋碗，熱水一注就縮手，多數不是手笨，是碗沿太直。第一隻，合手比好看要緊。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>量一次就夠</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/weighing-tea/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/weighing-tea/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>入門沖泡</category>
    <description>「放一匙就行了。」可是同一隻茶匙，裝滿烏龍和裝滿白茶，重量差很遠。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>水也有味道</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/water-before-tea/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/water-before-tea/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>入門沖泡</category>
    <description>以前我坐下來就急着開茶聞香，水是甚麼味道，從沒先嚐過。後來才發現，有些毛病，加多少茶都蓋不住。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>冷杯偷走十度</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/temperature-as-choice/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/temperature-as-choice/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>入門沖泡</category>
    <description>天一冷，我燙杯的次數就多了。同一壺剛滾的水，落到茶葉上的那一刻，未必還是你以為的溫度。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>十秒之後又十秒</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/when-to-pour/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/when-to-pour/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>入門沖泡</category>
    <description>計時器一響，學生拿起蓋碗，對着公道杯停了一下，才開始倒。那一下猶豫，茶葉沒有停。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>只改一樣</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/one-change-at-a-time/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/one-change-at-a-time/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>入門沖泡</category>
    <description>水放涼了，茶減半了，時間也縮短了，第二泡果然淡了，卻說不上好喝。剛才哪一步出錯，仍然是個謎。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>把濾網提起來</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/single-cup-brewing/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/single-cup-brewing/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>入門沖泡</category>
    <description>濾網從杯裏提起，一滴茶湯落在鍵盤邊。一隻杯泡茶，難處往往就在這一提一放之間。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>等它涼一點</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/tea-after-cooling/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/tea-after-cooling/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>入門沖泡</category>
    <description>茶剛出湯，有人端起就喝，然後縮着嘴吸一口涼氣。那一口嚐到的，多半只有熱。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>第三泡收手</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/last-infusion/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/last-infusion/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>入門沖泡</category>
    <description>茶喝完，第一句問「能泡幾次」，好像泡數愈多愈划算。我更想知道，哪一泡令你停下來多喝一口。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>不必泡回店裏</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/home-tea-tastes-different/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/home-tea-tastes-different/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>入門沖泡</category>
    <description>「在店裏明明很好喝的。」說這句話的人，多半已經在家泡了兩三次，開始懷疑是茶，還是自己。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>香氣比葉先到</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/smelling-dry-leaves/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/smelling-dry-leaves/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>感官品飲</category>
    <description>潮濕的日子，我開茶袋特別慢。袋口一鬆，香氣比葉片先到，有沒有一絲不對勁，也是這一刻最清楚。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>鼻子沒有圖鑑</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/aroma-is-a-description/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/aroma-is-a-description/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>感官品飲</category>
    <description>有人說了一句蘭香，鄰座便低頭苦想蘭花是甚麼氣味。想到最後，杯裏那陣香已經散了。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>苦在舌頭</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/bitterness-and-astringency/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/bitterness-and-astringency/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>感官品飲</category>
    <description>學生放下杯，只說一句「這杯很苦澀」，就沒有下文。我問他，是苦，還是澀？他想了一會，答不上來。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>茶湯厚在哪裏</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/what-is-body/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/what-is-body/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>感官品飲</category>
    <description>茶桌邊有人說這杯好厚。我問厚在哪裏，對方想了想，說像喝湯多過像喝水。這已經是很好的描述。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>杯放低之後</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/aftertaste-and-time/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/aftertaste-and-time/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>感官品飲</category>
    <description>杯還未放穩，「好喝」兩個字已經出口。我通常請人先等一等，讓口裏留下的東西自己走完。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>葉子攤開之後</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/reading-wet-leaves/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/reading-wet-leaves/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>感官品飲</category>
    <description>一片葉的邊緣泛紅，葉心還帶綠。茶喝淡了，這些製作留下的痕跡，才慢慢看得清楚。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>每頁都寫香</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/write-tasting-notes/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/write-tasting-notes/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>感官品飲</category>
    <description>翻開舊筆記，一頁寫滿「香、甜、滑」，幾款茶看起來一模一樣。當時的感受是真的，只是字眼太寬，裝不下細節。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>把標籤翻過去</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/blind-tasting-at-home/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/blind-tasting-at-home/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>感官品飲</category>
    <description>兩包茶擺在桌上，一包貴，一包平。還未開袋，我心裏已經替它們排好了位。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>那杯水沒有倒錯</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/between-two-teas/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/between-two-teas/</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>感官品飲</category>
    <description>茶杯旁多放一杯清水，常有客人以為我倒錯了。那杯水沒有倒錯，它是留給舌頭歇一歇的。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>這杯適合我</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/liking-is-not-ranking/</link>
