    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <category>普洱筆記</category>
    <description>「這是幾十年的老茶。」話一出口，桌邊的人都不好意思再問。我偏偏覺得，這時才最該問。</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>兩個字不夠</title>
    <link>https://teabonvivant.github.io/tang-wei-tea/journal/puer-brewing-record/</link>
